      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK MARVEL (8) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led for much of the way before being grabbed late, finishing a 1.5 lengths second at this track over 500m in 28.13. Must come into calculations. GERALDTON CREW (6) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at Horsham in a handy 27.45 beating Paw Lampades. Sure to measure up. CANYA TORNADO (4) is looking to continue his winning ways off a strong 30.03 victory in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Should be in this for a long way. PAW NIMBUS (7) was in the money last time at Sandown (29.81) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a head second. Has already won two times from this draw.",
